<title>UK: SNCF sets 400 mln Dkr bond due December 2004.</title>
<headline>SNCF sets 400 mln Dkr bond due December 2004.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager BBL.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SOCIETE NATIONALE DES CHEMINS DE FER</p>
<p> AMT    400 MLN DKR   COUPON     6.375     MATURITY    06.DEC.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.0     PAY DATE   S06.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 LISTING    LUX	 S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 10-50     PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    LUX	 HOME CTRY  FRANCE    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.75	SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
